  "code" : "public int findKthPositive(int[] arr, int k) {\n    int low = 0, high = arr.length - 1;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        int missing = arr[mid] - (mid + 1);\n        if (missing < k) {\n            low = mid + 1;\n        } else {\n            high = mid - 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return low + k;\n}",
